<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-19T03:43:48.459Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:43:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces have carried out an airstrike that destroyed gang leader Jeff's luxury mansion and later demolished a gang stronghold, killing about 20 gang members, while Haitian security forces retook the national stadium after two years of gang control. Haiti formalised a security pact with El Salvador and deployed Salvadoran troops who have engaged in combat against gangs, prompting both supportive and oppositional street protests. The United Nations warned that anti-gang operations must prioritise civilian protection, and the EU imposed sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOSnYtVjNLWEY0U3JPeTk1OEE4NDVnWnJGNHBfemVDVFhfUGsxNThheTh2c195UlBKRkZCMlJWS1dDWFZJMmZwMk9FeEo2WjFaRFBqeGhNRzhvWU5NNFRybkgtWFZhSWZFdTJTYVJCeDBRM3NyemJKUGRwWDU0X0N0XzZMXzBONnp5ZGpoWTJma2trYUZ5U2h3eDdQbFhSb0t4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/18/bukele-confirms-airstrike-on-haitian-gang-leader-jeffs-luxury-mansion&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOVHA1Y3h1M05Wd0dkTnRlMmVwbkxPOEJqQlZfS3docHVmTzBGSDc4akRpVmM2TzRmMjE4WjJCTURuWm5QTGxJc3h6c3B2TEk0RldiYm44elZCQVB0emhLNjF3VFBLZjM0YmZhNEJsbXcwWXFCMVZhRWpFWWExaHkxUV9ZakZzWjFWVEJXaXF1X0hYU05wcmtYMTRocTBkNmlCT3Zid2VPQVZ5MnE4X1M5bjZn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNa2tQTGxLQ1JKeHRrUUZZei01TmNaYUhlajdTcVo5OExJcHhsTjVfQjBRb2hUNXpVM0c4STd6Q2FQbWdZczZyeXVTWERBZ0c1SFVSSU8zRktGWndxZThwdWxMaGlXdUdjM2RmWndUT0w5SVpweU9VUnRL